{"data":{"actorId":"01KSPWEZWS89N7M7Y97XMXP6JV","createdAt":"2026-08-20T17:16:07.542Z","eventType":"comment.status_changed","id":"17","payload":{"from":"open","reason":"Fixed by removal in 07a889ee0: captureCommitSnapshotsForInFlightTasks, captureInFlightTaskCommitSnapshot, and the headHasCheckpointTrailer gate are deleted — there is no commit-time snapshot write left to race PostCommit's state read. Subagent content now reaches the commit's checkpoint via the condensation materializer (PR #2032's task-record model): PostCommit's own condensation reads task records under MutateSessionState and stores each record's transcript-so-far directly, so the ordering hazard this finding described no longer exists.","to":"resolved"},"reviewId":"01M0BPVR957H64S7CVFP7EP59N","targetId":"01M0BPVR9PFZ7KRABEWSXBWK05","targetType":"review_comment","trailId":"01M09WK1QC1B0BRSSR8G284MJX"},"event":"comment.status_changed"}
