{"data":{"actorId":"01KSPWEZWS89N7M7Y97XMXP6JV","createdAt":"2026-08-20T18:19:10.622Z","eventType":"comment.status_changed","id":"25","payload":{"from":"open","reason":"Addressed in 878027a2f. The swept case now has its own branch with a Debug log, so it is distinguishable from the read-error fallback. Treating swept-as-ended is deliberately NOT the fix: freshState == nil means the sweeper (finalizeExitedSessions or endSessionNow) removed the state, and both condense as part of ending the session — the just-completed record is materialized by whoever removed it. Condensing here instead would either duplicate that work or operate on state that no longer exists.","to":"resolved"},"reviewId":"01M0G4KCP58ANF6N5DFNPRSB1E","targetId":"01M0G4KCPC273KKVAGJZ2KME1E","targetType":"review_comment","trailId":"01M09WK1QC1B0BRSSR8G284MJX"},"event":"comment.status_changed"}
{"data":{"actorId":"01KSPWEZWS89N7M7Y97XMXP6JV","createdAt":"2026-08-20T18:19:11.573Z","eventType":"comment.status_changed","id":"26","payload":{"from":"open","reason":"Bounded, and not the wedge the doc disclaims. The doc's 'must never wedge condensation' means a poisoned record must not fail the checkpoint write — that holds: it produces zero payloads and condensation completes normally. A live record that never completes costs one skip-and-warn per condensation, never a retry of real work and never data loss (a poisoned AgentID has no storable filename in the first place). The main terminal path is covered: when the owner exits, finalizeExitedSessions completes live records before ending the session (c9cf2de88), and an ENDED+FullyCondensed session with leftovers classifies healthy. Deleting a live record to stop the warning would discard a pointer while its agent may still be running, which is the worse trade. Recorded as a known gap on PR #2032 rather than fixed.","to":"dismissed"},"reviewId":"01M0G4KCP58ANF6N5DFNPRSB1E","targetId":"01M0G4KCPHS14KGGZ3B245MGSK","targetType":"review_comment","trailId":"01M09WK1QC1B0BRSSR8G284MJX"},"event":"comment.status_changed"}
